OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister 'does not accept'
OL,4,Athere is no more money for Stormont
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Minister Michelle O'Neill has
OL,7,Fsaid she "does not accept" the
OL,8,Fgovernment's assertion that there is no
OL,9,Fmore money on offer to the Stormont
OL,10,Fexecutive, amid ongoing stalemate over
OL,11,Fthe budget.
OL,13,FShe was responding to remarks by the
OL,14,FSecretary of State Sir Chris Bryant
OL,15,Fafter he accused executive ministers of
OL,16,Fbeing financially "irresponsible".
OL,18,FThe executive has not agreed a budget
OL,19,Ffor this year, blaming the UK's
OL,20,Fdevolution funding formula for leaving
OL,21,Fit short.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
