OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister 'does not accept'
OL,4,Athere is no more money for Stormont
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdditional funding of about #1.5bn
OL,7,Fwould be released in three tranches,
OL,8,Fwith #525m available this year.
